            <a href="/[[~166]]" class="card" data-tag="other" data-cat="consulting">
                <span class="card__image"><span class="card__image-container">
                    <img src="/assets/css/img/portfolio/09-zetta.webp" alt="" class="card__image-bg">
                    <span class="card__image-logo"><img src="/assets/css/img/portfolio/09-zetta.svg" alt=""></span>
                </span></span>
                <span class="card__wrapper">
                    <span class="head">
                        Дискавери фаза для Зетта Страхование
