                    <span class="card__image-logo"><img src="/assets/css/img/portfolio/10-auchan.svg" alt=""></span>
                </span></span>
                <span class="card__wrapper">
                    <span class="head">
                        Дискавери фаза для АШАН
                    </span>
                    <span class="desc">
